# Pairs with KeepPolicyHonoured. The clock steps backwards, so a backup a
# pass judged expired is young again by the time the pass deletes it. The
# model's clock is monotonic; this mutation shows the property depends on it.
MODULE: KeepPolicyHonouredClockStepsBack
TARGET: KeepPolicyHonoured
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the clock may step backwards
PERTURBS: Tick

--- FIND
    /\ now < MaxTime
    /\ now' = now + 1
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the clock may step back.
    /\ now' \in {n \in 0..MaxTime : n # now}
--- END